<title>USA: Urbandale SSD, Iowa, $1.4 mln won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>Urbandale SSD, Iowa, $1.4 mln won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank said it won $1.400 million of Urbandale Sanitary Sewer District, Iowa, general obligation bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.13 percent.</p>
</text>
